To find the template type code that is most commonly used in documents, you can use the following SQL query:

```sql
SELECT T.template_type_code FROM Ref_template_types T INNER JOIN Templates TT ON T.template_type_code = TT.template_type_code INNER JOIN Documents D ON TT.template_id = D.template_id GROUP BY T.template_type_code ORDER BY COUNT(D.document_id) DESC LIMIT 1;

